\n                            alt=\"Unitree G1 Humanoid Robot\" class=\"floating-animation\"> -->\n                        <img src=\"img/hero.webp\" alt=\"Aura Humanoid Robot\" class=\"floating-animation\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- About Section -->\n        <section id=\"about\" class=\"about section-padding\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"section-header reveal-on-scroll\">\n                    <span class=\"badge\">SSM: 003884766-K</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title\">About AURA HUMANOID TECH</h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"about-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"about-text reveal-on-scroll\">\n                        <p class=\"lead\">We are a technology-focused business specializing in humanoid robotics and\n                            innovative robotic experiences.</p>\n                        <p>At AURA HUMANOID TECH, we bring next-generation robotic capabilities into real-world\n                            environments. Our focus is on delivering premium service, professional execution, and\n                            undeniable reliability for our corporate clients.</p>\n                        <p>We believe in the power of interactive technology to transform events, education, and brand\n                            experiences, ensuring that every deployment is executed with precision and corporate\n                            readiness.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"about-features reveal-on-scroll delay-1\">\n                        <div class=\"feature-card glass-panel\">\n                            <h3>Innovation</h3>\n                            <p>Deploying the latest in humanoid mobility and interaction.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"feature-card glass-panel\">\n                            <h3>Professionalism</h3>\n                            <p>Corporate-ready solutions tailored to your brand.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"feature-card glass-panel\">\n                            <h3>Reliability</h3>\n                            <p>Flawless execution with dedicated technical support.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"feature-card glass-panel\">\n                            <h3>Premium Service</h3>\n                            <p>End-to-end management of your robotic experience.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Flagship Robotics Section -->\n        <section id=\"robotics\" class=\"robotics section-padding bg-darker\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"section-header center reveal-on-scroll\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Flagship Robotics</h2>\n                    <p class=\"section-desc\">Experience the capabilities of the Aura Humanoid Robot.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"robotics-showcase\">\n                    <div class=\"robotics-visual reveal-on-scroll\">\n                        <div class=\"image-mockup mockup-full\">\n                            <img src=\"img/flagship.jpeg\" alt=\"Aura Humanoid Robot\">\n                            <div class=\"tech-overlay\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"robotics-details reveal-on-scroll delay-1\">\n                        <h3 class=\"highlight-cyan\">Aura Humanoid Robot</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">Our flagship robotic platform offers unparalleled mobility, interaction, and\n                            stage presence for any premium environment.</p>\n\n                        <ul class=\"capability-list\">\n                            <li><span class=\"icon\"></span> <strong>Humanoid Movement:</strong> Fluid, dynamic\n                                articulation that captivates audiences.</li>\n                            <li><span class=\"icon\"></span> <strong>Intelligent Mobility:</strong> Navigates complex\n                                environments and stages seamlessly.</li>\n                            <li><span class=\"icon\"></span> <strong>Interactive Demonstrations:</strong> Engaging\n                                interactions for guests and attendees.</li>\n                            <li><span class=\"icon\"></span> <strong>Stage Interaction:</strong> Perfect for keynotes,\n                                product unveils, and performances.</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"accessories-section mt-5 reveal-on-scroll\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-center mb-4\">Professional Event Infrastructure</h3>\n                    <div class=\"accessories-grid\">\n                        <div class=\"accessory-card glass-panel\">\n                            <h4>High-Capacity Batteries</h4>\n                            <p>Ensuring extended operation and uninterrupted event usage.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"accessory-card glass-panel\">\n                            <h4>Fast Chargers</h4>\n                            <p>Delivering efficient operational turnaround during full-day schedules.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"accessory-card glass-panel\">\n                            <h4>Heavy-Duty Transit Flight Case</h4>\n                            <p>Guaranteeing safe transportation and professional event logistics.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"robotics-video-section reveal-on-scroll\">\n                    <div class=\"section-header center\">\n                        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Experience the Future of Humanoid Robotics</h2>\n                        <p class=\"section-desc\">Discover how humanoid robots can engage, entertain, assist, and interact\n                            with people in real-world environments.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"robotics-video-frame\">\n                        <video controls preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"img/flagship.jpeg\">\n                            <source src=\"video/aura-robot-demo.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n                            Your browser does not support video playback. An approved AURA robotics demonstration video\n                            will be added here.\n                        </video>\n                        <div class=\"video-pending-note\">Robotics demonstration video coming soon</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Applications Section -->\n        <section id=\"applications\" class=\"applications section-padding\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"section-header center reveal-on-scroll\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Applications & Experiences</h2>\n                    <p class=\"section-desc\">Explore what we can create for your next event with our humanoid robotics.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"applications-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"app-card glass-panel reveal-on-scroll\">\n                        <div class=\"app-visual\">\n                            <img src=\"img/corporate-launch.webp\" alt=\"Corporate technology launch stage\">\n                            <span class=\"app-label\">Concept Visualization</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"app-content\">\n                            <h3>Corporate Launches</h3>\n                     