               <span class=\"app-label\">Concept Visualization</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"app-content\">\n                            <h3>VIP Weddings & Private Events</h3>\n                            <p>Deliver unforgettable premium experiences like an exclusive event greeter, ring bearer,\n                                tray bearer, and a highly special entrance experience.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- How It Works Section -->\n        <section class=\"process section-padding bg-darker\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"section-header center reveal-on-scroll\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title\">How It Works</h2>\n                    <p class=\"section-desc\">A seamless process to integrate robotics into your event.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"process-steps\">\n                    <div class=\"step reveal-on-scroll\">\n                        <div class=\"step-number\">01</div>\n                        <h3>Discuss</h3>\n                        <p>Tell us about your event, venue, audience, and specific requirements.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"step reveal-on-scroll delay-1\">\n                        <div class=\"step-number\">02</div>\n                        <h3>Plan</h3>\n                        <p>We design and propose the appropriate robotic experience tailored for your event.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"step reveal-on-scroll delay-2\">\n                        <div class=\"step-number\">03</div>\n                        <h3>Deploy</h3>\n                        <p>Our professional team prepares, transports, and coordinates the entire robotic setup.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"step reveal-on-scroll delay